tus":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"八郎の弟。八郎を兄としても剣士としても心より慕っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"幼少の頃病弱であった八郎とは異なり健康な身体に恵まれており、兄の背中に追いつこうと日々剣技の修行に明け暮れている。どこか憂いを秘めた兄とは異なり明るく朗らかな熱血青年。その分、直情的な面もあるのが玉に瑕。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"19617","sourceWorkId":"25802","spoiler":false}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/02/0297c84ae1b1d133f81159b79096bd0a0f8ac3ae429452696826fc0038286f36.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/45/4541d1fe394dcc48e46a02e98e75383e6e299f10cf29325c2663be219f1627bc.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"あじ 秋刀魚","creatorId":"vndb:s11","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s11","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s11","name":"前田 恵","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:75033","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_c68972","characterName":"森 林太郎","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[],"egsCharacterIds":["19618"],"vndbCharacterId":"c68972"},"originalCharacterName":"森 林太郎","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"亥朔の友人。津和野藩の御殿医を代々務める森家の嫡男だが、難産を経て生まれたためか身体が弱く、柳のような身体をしている。外出時にも何か１冊は本を携えるほどの読書の虫。病弱で内気な上に女子の様に端正な顔をしているため粗野な武士の子弟からとかく虐められがちだが、学問所で知り合った伊庭亥朔に助けられて以来、心を通わせている。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"19618","sourceWorkId":"25802","spoiler":false}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/7d/7d16b4b1ed46faac299800433caae64a5d20a1192d8322b0dd984483772b3df2.webp","fall